# NOTE: staticfiles/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# Vercel has no build shell to run collectstatic, so the collected
# static files are committed and served by WhiteNoise from inside
# the serverless function. Re-run collectstatic after changing
# anything in static/ and commit the result.

